{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# OpsBoard — M11 monitoring (`${env}`)\nDashboard **không dùng App Insights** cho metric/log (topic.md M11): metric đọc thẳng từ Azure Monitor, log từ Log Analytics `${workspace_name}`. App Insights chỉ ở ô *Trace*. Code: `infra/app/workbooks/m11.workbook.json.tftpl`."
      },
      "name": "header"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "b1a1f1a0-0d21-4c11-9a11-000000000001",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Khoảng thời gian",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                { "durationMs": 900000 },
                { "durationMs": 3600000 },
                { "durationMs": 14400000 },
                { "durationMs": 43200000 },
                { "durationMs": 86400000 },
                { "durationMs": 604800000 }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": { "json": "## 1 · App performance — response time · request rate · failure rate (metric Web App)" },
      "name": "h-app"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "content": {
        "chartId": "m11-response-time",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.web/sites",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": ["${be_id}", "${fe_id}"],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
        "metrics": [
          { "namespace": "microsoft.web/sites", "metric": "microsoft.web/sites--HttpResponseTime", "aggregation": 4 }
        ],
        "title": "Response time trung bình (giây)",
        "gridSettings": { "rowLimit": 10000 }
      },
      "customWidth": "33",
      "name": "app-response-time"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "content": {
        "chartId": "m11-requests",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.web/sites",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": ["${be_id}", "${fe_id}"],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
        "metrics": [
          { "namespace": "microsoft.web/sites", "metric": "microsoft.web/sites--Requests", "aggregation": 1 }
        ],
        "title": "Request rate (Requests, tổng theo khoảng)",
        "gridSettings": { "rowLimit": 10000 }
      },
      "customWidth": "33",
      "name": "app-requests"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "content": {
        "chartId": "m11-http5xx",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.web/sites",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": ["${be_id}", "${fe_id}"],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
        "metrics": [
          { "namespace": "microsoft.web/sites", "metric": "microsoft.web/sites--Http5xx", "aggregation": 1 }
        ],
        "title": "Failure — số 5xx (metric)",
        "gridSettings": { "rowLimit": 10000 }
      },
      "customWidth": "33",
      "name": "app-http5xx"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "// Q2: % 5xx theo 5 phút — từ log, không cần App Insights (không tính /health, /api/version)\nAppServiceHTTPLogs\n| where _ResourceId has \"/sites/\" and _ResourceId !has \"/slots/\"\n| where CsUriStem !in (\"/health\", \"/version\", \"/api/version\")\n| extend app = tostring(split(_ResourceId, \"/\")[8])\n| summarize fail_pct = round(100.0 * countif(ScStatus >= 500) / count(), 2) by bin(TimeGenerated, 5m), app\n| render timechart",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Failure rate % (log, theo 5 phút)",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": ["${workspace_id}"],
        "visualization": "timechart",
        "chartSettings": { "showMetrics": false, "showLegend": true }
      },
      "customWidth": "50",
      "name": "app-fail-pct"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "// Q3: p50/p95 thời gian xử lý theo path (ms)\nAppServiceHTTPLogs\n| where _ResourceId has \"/sites/\" and _ResourceId !has \"/slots/\"\n| where CsUriStem !in (\"/health\", \"/version\", \"/api/version\")\n| extend app = tostring(split(_ResourceId, \"/\")[8])\n| summarize requests = count(), p50_ms = percentile(TimeTaken, 50), p95_ms = percentile(TimeTaken, 95) by app, CsUriStem\n| order by p95_ms desc\n| take 15",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "p50 / p95 theo path (log) — request chậm nhất lên đầu",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": ["${workspace_id}"],
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "customWidth": "50",
      "name": "app-latency-by-path"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": { "json": "## 2 · Infra App Service — CPU · memory · HTTP queue (metric của Plan `${plan_name}`, chung cho be + fe)" },
      "name": "h-plan"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "content": {
        "chartId": "m11-plan-cpu",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.web/serverfarms",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": ["${plan_id}"],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
        "metrics": [
          { "namespace": "microsoft.web/serverfarms", "metric": "microsoft.web/serverfarms--CpuPercentage", "aggregation": 4 }
        ],
        "title": "CPU % (alert > 80% / 15 phút)",
        "gridSettings": { "rowLimit": 10000 }
      },
      "customWidth": "33",
      "name": "plan-cpu"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "content": {
        "chartId": "m11-plan-memory",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.web/serverfarms",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": ["${plan_id}"],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
        "metrics": [
          { "namespace": "microsoft.web/serverfarms", "metric": "microsoft.web/serverfarms--MemoryPercentage", "aggregation": 4 }
        ],
        "title": "Memory %",
        "gridSettings": { "rowLimit": 10000 }
      },
      "customWidth": "33",
      "name": "plan-memory"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "content": {
        "chartId": "m11-plan-queue",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.web/serverfarms",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": ["${plan_id}"],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
        "metrics": [
          { "namespace": "microsoft.web/serverfarms", "metric": "microsoft.web/serverfarms--HttpQueueLength", "aggregation": 4 }
        ],
        "title": "HTTP queue length",
        "gridSettings": { "rowLimit": 10000 }
      },
      "customWidth": "33",
      "name": "plan-http-queue"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": { "json": "## 3 · Infra MySQL — CPU · active connections · storage (metric `${mysql_name}`)" },
      "name": "h-mysql"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "content": {
        "chartId": "m11-mysql-cpu",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": ["${mysql_id}"],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
        "metrics": [
          { "namespace": "microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers", "metric": "microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers--cpu_percent", "aggregation": 3 }
        ],
        "title": "CPU % (max)",
        "gridSettings": { "rowLimit": 10000 }
      },
      "customWidth": "33",
      "name": "mysql-cpu"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "content": {
        "chartId": "m11-mysql-connections",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": ["${mysql_id}"],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
        "metrics": [
          { "namespace": "microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers", "metric": "microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers--active_connections", "aggregation": 3 }
        ],
        "title": "Active connections (max; alert > 128)",
        "gridSettings": { "rowLimit": 10000 }
      },
      "customWidth": "33",
      "name": "mysql-connections"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "content": {
        "chartId": "m11-mysql-storage",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": ["${mysql_id}"],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
        "metrics": [
          { "namespace": "microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers", "metric": "microsoft.dbformysql/flexibleservers--storage_percent", "aggregation": 3 }
        ],
        "title": "Storage % (max)",
        "gridSettings": { "rowLimit": 10000 }
      },
      "customWidth": "33",
      "name": "mysql-storage"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": { "json": "## 4 · Health · alert đang bắn" },
      "name": "h-health"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "content": {
        "chartId": "m11-health",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.web/sites",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": ["${be_id}", "${fe_id}"],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
        "metrics": [
          { "namespace": "microsoft.web/sites", "metric": "microsoft.web/sites--HealthCheckStatus", "aggregation": 4 }
        ],
        "title": "Health check status (100 = mọi instance khoẻ)",
        "gridSettings": { "rowLimit": 10000 }
      },
      "customWidth": "50",
      "name": "health-status"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "alertsmanagementresources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.alertsmanagement/alerts\"\n| where tostring(properties.essentials.targetResourceGroup) =~ \"${resource_group_name}\"\n| extend fired = todatetime(properties.essentials.startDateTime), rule = tostring(properties.essentials.alertRule), severity = tostring(properties.essentials.severity), condition = tostring(properties.essentials.monitorCondition), state = tostring(properties.essentials.alertState)\n| where fired > ago(7d)\n| project fired, condition, severity, rule = tostring(split(rule, \"/\")[-1]), state\n| order by fired desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Alert 7 ngày qua (Fired = đang bắn)",
        "queryType": 1,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
        "crossComponentResources": ["/subscriptions/${subscription_id}"],
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "customWidth": "50",
      "name": "alerts-firing"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": { "json": "## 5 · Log · trace — chuyện gì đã xảy ra với request này" },
      "name": "h-logs"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "// Q5: lỗi mới nhất từ log JSON của app (stdout → AppServiceConsoleLogs)\nAppServiceConsoleLogs\n| where _ResourceId has \"/sites/\"\n| extend log = parse_json(ResultDescription)\n| where tostring(log.level) == \"error\" or toint(log.status) >= 500\n| project TimeGenerated, app = tostring(split(_ResourceId, \"/\")[8]), level = tostring(log.level), event = tostring(log.event), path = tostring(log.path), status = toint(log.status), error = tostring(log.error), detail = tostring(log.detail), trace_id = tostring(log.trace_id)\n| order by TimeGenerated desc\n| take 50",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Lỗi mới nhất (level = error, hoặc request ≥ 500 kèm trace_id)",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": ["${workspace_id}"],
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "logs-errors"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "// Q8: request lỗi trong trace (App Insights, cùng workspace) nối đúng dòng log của CHÍNH request đó.\n// Khoá = trace_id + span_id: health checker của App Service gửi traceparent CỐ ĐỊNH (đo 29/09) nên\n// chỉ trace_id thì một request ghép nhầm với mọi dòng /health cùng trace.\nAppRequests\n| where Success == false\n| project TimeGenerated, role = AppRoleName, request = Name, ResultCode, DurationMs = round(DurationMs, 1), OperationId, Id\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    AppServiceConsoleLogs\n    | extend log = parse_json(ResultDescription)\n    | where isnotempty(log.span_id)\n    | project trace_id = tostring(log.trace_id), span_id = tostring(log.span_id), log_status = toint(log.status), log_duration_ms = tolong(log.duration_ms)\n  ) on $left.OperationId == $right.trace_id, $left.Id == $right.span_id\n| project-away trace_id, span_id\n| order by TimeGenerated desc\n| take 50",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Trace — request lỗi ↔ log cùng trace_id (mở end-to-end transaction trong App Insights bằng OperationId)",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": ["${workspace_id}"],
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "trace-join"
    }
  ],
  "fallbackResourceIds": ["azure monitor"],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json"
}
